                <note rend="inline" type="source">838.51/2330a: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Chargé in Haiti</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >McGurk</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1931-09-25T17:00:00-04:00">September 25, 1931—5
                        p.m.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>66. From de la Rue for Pixley. Advise immediately has the detailed budget been
                    officially submitted to our office for study in compliance with the agreement of
                    August 5th.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Stimson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
